sequenceDiagram
    participant You
    participant branchdiff
    participant AI
    You->>branchdiff: Open change map (toolbar)
    branchdiff-->>You: Orientation diagram, zero tokens
    You->>AI: /branchdiff-review
    AI->>branchdiff: agent diff (+ change map,<br/>saved to BRANCHDIFF_CONTEXT_FILE)
    AI-->>branchdiff: agent comment [tag] ...
    You->>You: triage: fix / dismiss / reply
    You->>AI: /branchdiff-resolve
    AI->>branchdiff: pull latest PR comments first
    AI-->>You: fixes applied, threads resolved
